Subject: merging/moving validate functions
Message-ID: <bKM-glhMXcs.rjUoeKjmgvgJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/bKM-glhMXcs/m/rjUoeKjmgvgJ>
